   "text": "Missing one day doesn't break a habit, missing the second day does. Say you run three times a week"
  },
  {
   "s": 5.2,
   "e": 10.14,
   "text": "and on Wednesday you missed it, what you do next decides the habit. Most people try to catch up,"
  },
  {
   "s": 10.34,
   "e": 14.18,
   "text": "two runs on Thursday, it feels heavy so they skip that two, now one misses two."
  },
  {
   "s": 14.56,
   "e": 20.18,
   "text": "One don't double up, just the next run at its normal size. Two, book it now, Thursday 7 am"
  },
  {
   "s": 20.18,
   "e": 25.02,
   "text": "in your calendar like a meeting. Three, if Thursday goes wrong, 10 minutes counts, zero doesn't."
  },
